}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg max-w-none","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-8","children":"While the housing boom of a few years ago saw a surge in notary loan signing agents, some might think that opportunity has passed. However, I'm here to dispel that myth! The current market dynamics heading into 2026 present a unique and potentially even more advantageous time to embark on this fulfilling career path."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-8","children":"With expected interest rate adjustments and steady homebuying activity, the demand for qualified loan signing agents remains strong. This translates to greater access to high-quality signings and the potential for consistent income. Moreover, unlike the earlier frenzy, entering the field now grants you the benefit of a stabilized landscape, allowing you to build a sustainable practice without the pressure of a saturated market."}],"$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"]}]]}]]}],["$L23"],"$L24"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$L25",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$26",[]],"S":true}
